  "id": "multifactorial",
  "term": "multifactorial",
  "definition": "Multifactorial means that an outcome is understood as arising from several interacting influences rather than a single cause. In this context, mental health is seen as shaped by a combination of experiences and conditions before migration, during migration, and after resettlement.",
